WEBVTT

01:25.080 --> 01:28.120
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:52.200 --> 01:53.200
Kang Ju.

01:54.120 --> 01:56.360
Wake up!

01:57.160 --> 01:59.200
We escaped. Wake up!

02:01.400 --> 02:04.000
Wake up!

02:07.400 --> 02:13.320
Stay alive. I'll take you away…

04:00.200 --> 04:02.160
Duanwu! Duanwu!

04:03.720 --> 04:04.720
Duanwu!

04:04.800 --> 04:07.160
I know you care about me the most.

04:07.240 --> 04:10.200
Wherever you are, nothing feels hard.

04:10.280 --> 04:13.640
Wherever you are, that's home.

04:40.560 --> 04:42.520
Wherever my leader is, I am too.

04:42.600 --> 04:43.720
I, Cao Da,

04:43.800 --> 04:46.240
am absolutely loyal to the convoy,
never abandoning it.

04:52.440 --> 04:54.360
-My name is Loud.
-What?

04:54.440 --> 04:55.360
Loud.

04:55.960 --> 04:57.000
Duanwu.

04:58.640 --> 04:59.840
I'm not leaving.

04:59.920 --> 05:01.080
You can speak now!

05:02.520 --> 05:04.440
-Yes.
-Really?

05:12.600 --> 05:14.000
First time in a carriage?

05:17.960 --> 05:19.360
Wishing you two,
when you raise your glasses,

05:19.440 --> 05:21.000
may you have all you desire!

05:21.080 --> 05:22.560
With a clink of glasses, gold pours in!

05:22.640 --> 05:24.360
With a toast, wealth abounds!

06:47.000 --> 06:48.320
Why?

06:50.320 --> 06:51.680
Yan Zijing,

06:52.800 --> 06:54.080
why on earth?

07:12.360 --> 07:14.280
You must be hungry. Have something to eat.

07:15.400 --> 07:16.440
Alright.

07:18.880 --> 07:19.880
Duanwu…

07:20.640 --> 07:21.520
Duanwu…

07:23.200 --> 07:24.080
Duanwu…

07:32.320 --> 07:35.240
-Kang Ju…
-Here, have some water.

07:35.320 --> 07:37.440
Where's Duanwu? Where's Duanwu?

07:38.040 --> 07:39.240
Have some water first.

07:41.000 --> 07:42.240
Where's Duanwu?

07:44.520 --> 07:47.600
-Where's Duanwu?
-We barely managed to escape.

07:47.680 --> 07:49.800
I… I couldn't look out for her.

07:54.600 --> 07:55.960
Don't…

07:56.040 --> 07:58.000
Don't move.

08:00.120 --> 08:01.920
-I'll go find Duanwu…
-Don't…

08:02.000 --> 08:06.360
Don't move! You're covered in wounds!
Don't move!

08:08.800 --> 08:10.800
I'll save her.

08:11.840 --> 08:13.360
-I'll save her.
-Go quickly…

08:13.440 --> 08:14.520
I'm going to find her.

08:14.600 --> 08:17.440
I left the water here.

08:17.520 --> 08:18.840
Here's some food.

08:43.640 --> 08:44.800
Duanwu.

08:56.040 --> 08:57.840
Your two teams will form a pincer.

08:57.920 --> 08:59.880
Make sure the enemy
doesn't break through here.

09:00.400 --> 09:01.440
Carry out the order.

09:02.120 --> 09:03.040
Yes, sir!

09:05.200 --> 09:06.200
General Pei.

09:06.720 --> 09:10.160
Mr. Zhang went to find the convoy.
Was there any trace?

09:11.360 --> 09:12.440
Not yet.

09:14.080 --> 09:15.000
How did you hurt your hand?

09:15.080 --> 09:17.560
-Should we have Doctor Liu take a look?
-I'm fine.

09:18.200 --> 09:21.000
I'm just worried
about Duanwu and Mr. Zhang's safety.

09:21.080 --> 09:23.880
Soldiers are licking blood off the blade
and fighting on the battlefield.

09:23.960 --> 09:26.920
Sometimes,
no news is better than any news.

09:27.600 --> 09:30.000
Jinran is brave and quick-witted.
Duanwu is blessed.

09:30.080 --> 09:31.080
They'll be fine.

09:32.480 --> 09:34.840
Report, General! The Black Dragon Bandits
have appeared at Langhuan Dockyard.

09:35.440 --> 09:37.640
Langhuan Dockyard?
Shouldn't they be at Piti Spring?

09:40.240 --> 09:41.280
Quickly, send the order.

09:41.360 --> 09:43.200
Dispatch two teams, one to Piti Spring
and one to Langhuan Dockyard.

09:43.280 --> 09:44.640
Ensure the safety of Jinran
and the convoy!

09:44.720 --> 09:45.640
Yes, sir!

09:48.440 --> 09:51.000
Lady Shiqi, don't worry.
Reinforcements will arrive soon.

09:51.080 --> 09:53.160
I have military duties to attend to.

09:53.240 --> 09:54.360
Don't worry.

09:55.240 --> 09:56.360
Farewell.

10:18.840 --> 10:21.840
Why hasn't Yan Zijing arrived yet?
Could he have backed out?

10:34.040 --> 10:35.760
-What's the situation?
-There's no sign of anyone nearby.

10:35.840 --> 10:38.480
But we received intel that bandits
have set an ambush in Langhuan Dockyard.

10:39.080 --> 10:41.720
The convoy suffered heavy losses.

10:45.760 --> 10:48.440
-The information might not be accurate.
-No.

10:49.960 --> 10:51.360
Yan Zijing wouldn't be this late.

10:51.440 --> 10:54.640
The convoy must have been ambushed
by bandits at Langhuan Dockyard.

10:58.760 --> 11:01.440
Quick, let's head to Langhuan Dockyard
immediately.

11:02.600 --> 11:03.520
Yes, sir!

11:10.280 --> 11:11.920
LANGHUAN DOCKYARD

11:25.760 --> 11:26.600
-Hurry, help out!
-Yes.

11:26.680 --> 11:27.520
-Yes, sir!
-Yes, sir!

11:31.920 --> 11:33.800
Where are the members
of Yan's Trading Convoy?

11:34.960 --> 11:36.320
Where are they?

11:36.400 --> 11:38.280
The convoy members are over there.

11:42.880 --> 11:45.600
-And over there! Go check on them!
-Yes, sir!

11:58.400 --> 11:59.800
Excuse me, sir.

12:01.280 --> 12:02.600
Excuse me, sir.

12:02.680 --> 12:05.080
I am Yuchi Wuyi,
Master of Langhuan Dockyard.

12:05.160 --> 12:06.160
May I ask who you are?

12:06.240 --> 12:08.520
I am Zhang Jinran, a chancellor
from the Institute of Literary Studies.

12:09.040 --> 12:10.320
Yan Zijing is my old friend.

12:10.400 --> 12:12.640
What happened to Yan's Trading Convoy?

12:13.560 --> 12:15.560
The Black Dragon Bandits ambushed
Langhuan Dockyard.

12:16.720 --> 12:18.720
Zijing led the convoy
in a fierce fight to defend us.

12:18.800 --> 12:21.360
Only then could I lead
the merchants to escape.

12:21.880 --> 12:26.680
But everyone in the convoy died in battle.

12:27.960 --> 12:29.160
What did you say?

12:30.800 --> 12:32.000
And what about Duanwu?

12:33.520 --> 12:34.800
And Yan Zijing?

12:35.960 --> 12:37.160
Both of them…

12:38.280 --> 12:39.960
There's been no word.

12:47.680 --> 12:49.480
Quickly, send someone to find General Pei.

12:50.080 --> 12:53.000
Tell him to send more people here
to help with the aftermath.

12:54.520 --> 12:57.200
Master Yuchi,
I'll take some men to keep searching.

12:57.720 --> 13:00.160
If you find any clues,
contact me immediately.

13:00.760 --> 13:01.920
You take care too.

13:02.600 --> 13:05.680
And if you find any clues,
please inform me as well.

13:22.240 --> 13:23.760
-Any luck?
-No.

13:24.800 --> 13:27.560
Duanwu!

13:29.040 --> 13:30.080
Duanwu!

13:38.560 --> 13:39.520
Duanwu…

13:40.360 --> 13:42.920
Duanwu, where are you?

13:47.280 --> 13:49.960
Duanwu!

13:52.560 --> 13:53.560
Duanwu!

13:54.480 --> 13:55.520
Duanwu!

13:56.120 --> 13:58.160
Duanwu!

13:58.240 --> 13:59.240
Duanwu!

14:02.320 --> 14:03.480
Duanwu!

14:04.440 --> 14:05.280
Duanwu!

14:05.360 --> 14:07.560
-Duanwu!
-Duanwu!

14:07.640 --> 14:10.160
-Duanwu!
-Duanwu!

14:10.240 --> 14:11.520
Duanwu!

14:12.480 --> 14:14.000
-Duanwu!
-Duanwu!

14:15.040 --> 14:16.160
Duanwu!

15:01.440 --> 15:02.920
How's it going? Did you find her?

15:03.000 --> 15:04.680
Yes, we found her. Don't worry.

15:05.280 --> 15:06.880
Then why didn't you bring her back?

15:08.560 --> 15:09.920
She was rescued by some herders.

15:10.000 --> 15:12.240
I ran into a few
Black Dragon Bandits on the way.

15:12.320 --> 15:15.320
I was afraid of drawing their attention,
so I didn't dare to show myself.

15:15.840 --> 15:18.320
Don't worry. How are you?

15:18.400 --> 15:19.400
I'm fine.

15:20.520 --> 15:21.880
Her safety is all that matters.

15:23.080 --> 15:25.080
-Take me to see her. Let's go!
-Let's go.

15:25.760 --> 15:26.680
Let's go.

15:27.920 --> 15:29.520
-Let's go.
-Wait.

15:34.640 --> 15:35.680
We can't go.

15:37.600 --> 15:38.680
We can't go.

15:44.280 --> 15:45.640
What's the Black Dragon Bandits'
movement now?

15:45.720 --> 15:48.840
Li Kui ordered them to hunt you down.

15:50.320 --> 15:51.560
They're searching the whole city for you.

15:55.480 --> 15:56.480
Alright.

15:57.600 --> 15:58.840
Find two people

15:59.360 --> 16:02.080
to spread the word that I have
the blood-stained pearl.

16:03.080 --> 16:04.080
That way, Duanwu will be safer.

16:06.200 --> 16:07.240
Understood.

16:09.760 --> 16:13.800
Later, I'll take some men to fetch her.

16:14.400 --> 16:15.480
No need.

16:17.120 --> 16:18.280
I can't see her.

16:20.200 --> 16:21.680
The witch doctor is dead now,

16:24.640 --> 16:25.960
so I don't have long to live.

16:30.560 --> 16:35.000
In this final time, I just want

16:36.440 --> 16:37.760
to avenge my Yan family.

16:40.080 --> 16:44.160
Cao Da, Shrimp, Loud,

16:45.280 --> 16:46.240
Wei Yan,

16:47.040 --> 16:48.800
and all those people in the convoy.

16:50.040 --> 16:51.840
They all died for my revenge.

16:55.120 --> 16:56.480
I can't let Duanwu

16:58.720 --> 17:00.120
keep getting caught up in this danger.

17:00.200 --> 17:02.280
You can't blame yourself for this.

17:03.120 --> 17:04.560
We walked right into an ambush.

17:04.640 --> 17:08.920
When I take the men and fight back,
explain everything to her.

17:09.000 --> 17:10.599
She'll understand.

17:11.480 --> 17:13.040
You have to tell Duanwu

17:14.480 --> 17:15.960
or she'll hate you.

17:18.319 --> 17:19.800
Let her hate me, then.

17:20.880 --> 17:22.319
At least she'll be safe.

18:19.120 --> 18:22.280
Miss, you're awake! We saved you.

18:22.360 --> 18:25.000
My mother thought you wouldn't make it.

18:26.440 --> 18:27.440
Mom!

18:28.320 --> 18:30.080
-She's awake!
-She's awake?

18:31.360 --> 18:32.680
You're awake!

18:32.760 --> 18:36.160
Here, have some hot water to warm up.

18:36.680 --> 18:39.440
Miss, you're lucky. No vital injuries.

18:39.520 --> 18:40.520
Here.

18:43.640 --> 18:45.800
Miss, what's wrong?

18:47.080 --> 18:48.480
Where's your family?

18:55.160 --> 18:58.160
Alright, it's okay. I won't ask anymore.

19:19.160 --> 19:24.680
Dear, now that you've survived,
live on with all your strength.

19:31.600 --> 19:33.960
The setting sun fills the ground

19:34.040 --> 19:37.640
Deep feelings best forgotten

19:38.880 --> 19:43.000
Blood stains my clothes
Tears drench my chest

19:43.080 --> 19:47.840
In the chill of dusk, grief soaks my bed

19:49.080 --> 19:52.880
White bones lie buried beneath wild grass

19:52.960 --> 19:57.080
Yellow sands linger
In the shadowed old city

19:57.680 --> 19:58.720
Duanwu!

19:58.800 --> 20:00.360
-The convoy guards are trying to kill us!
-How can I bear

20:00.440 --> 20:02.120
-Run, Duanwu!
-To recall those days?

20:03.720 --> 20:08.800
Only a lonely soul chants a bitter song

20:16.160 --> 20:19.600
Yan Zijing, why?

20:20.320 --> 20:22.680
The world twists and turns
Hard to foretell

20:23.280 --> 20:27.000
And the human heart is a mystery as well

20:27.080 --> 20:30.480
A tune of "Sorrow's Veil" fills the air

20:31.000 --> 20:35.440
Pouring out tales of heartbreak
And despair

20:48.040 --> 20:49.720
Miss, it's time to eat.

21:11.280 --> 21:14.280
Master, Duanwu traded with the herders
for money and food.

21:14.360 --> 21:17.320
I searched a few places along the way,
but there's no sign of her.

21:22.920 --> 21:23.800
Any leads?

21:24.600 --> 21:26.480
Yan Zijing is seriously injured.
He can't have gone far. Track him down!

21:35.160 --> 21:37.560
The news that you have the blood-stained
pearl has already spread.

21:38.080 --> 21:40.600
Now, the Black Dragon Bandits
are all out searching for you.

21:40.680 --> 21:42.840
Duanwu should be safe.

21:43.360 --> 21:47.560
We need to leave as soon as possible,
otherwise, we might not get out.

21:47.640 --> 21:51.120
With Duanwu's nature and skills,
she'll be alright.

23:59.880 --> 24:03.000
White bones lie buried beneath wild grass

24:05.400 --> 24:10.440
Yellow sands linger
In the shadowed old city

24:13.280 --> 24:17.400
How can I bear to recall those days?

24:19.160 --> 24:21.560
Only a lonely soul chants

24:23.520 --> 24:26.320
A bitter song

24:31.720 --> 24:34.320
The world twists and turns
Hard to foretell

24:36.120 --> 24:39.760
And the human heart is a mystery as well

24:43.080 --> 24:46.520
A tune of "Sorrow's Veil" fills the air

24:48.440 --> 24:50.080
Pouring out tales

24:51.120 --> 24:53.480
Of heartbreak and despair

24:59.400 --> 25:01.040
"Sorrow's Veil"…

25:02.080 --> 25:03.520
"Sorrow's Veil"…

25:09.840 --> 25:11.960
Even heartbreaking matters

25:14.400 --> 25:15.880
must eventually end.

25:19.960 --> 25:21.160
Yan Zijing,

25:22.960 --> 25:24.600
I will surely find you.

25:27.440 --> 25:30.160
I'll make you explain to me in person.

26:08.760 --> 26:14.720
YUELAI INN

27:00.440 --> 27:01.720
Anyone here?

27:03.280 --> 27:04.600
Anyone here?

27:05.560 --> 27:06.920
Anyone here?

27:07.000 --> 27:09.400
Who is it? Can't a person sleep at night?

27:13.760 --> 27:16.320
-Got any water?
-No.

27:58.760 --> 28:00.080
I need a room.

28:02.880 --> 28:03.800
I have money.

28:17.800 --> 28:19.160
Go upstairs and find a room yourself.

28:39.360 --> 28:41.360
Wang Yu!

28:41.440 --> 28:42.680
Keep your voice down!

28:45.240 --> 28:47.160
There's fresh goods here.
We captured her from the desert.

28:48.960 --> 28:51.280
Someone nice arrived upstairs too.

28:51.360 --> 28:52.440
Alright, let's go.

29:03.080 --> 29:05.040
Madam, you've worked hard.

29:10.080 --> 29:11.160
What are you looking at?

29:33.200 --> 29:35.320
Miss, you're looking
so fresh and delicate,

29:35.400 --> 29:36.520
weak and sickly.

29:37.400 --> 29:40.760
You want to talk to me, huh?
Alright, talk.

29:40.840 --> 29:42.480
-Help me!
-Don't scream!

29:42.560 --> 29:43.920
Don't you scream.

29:44.000 --> 29:46.920
Scream all you want, it's useless.
There's no one here.

29:47.000 --> 29:48.240
Tomorrow, I'll sell you,

29:48.320 --> 29:52.320
and you'll sing ditties
to earn money for daily essentials.

29:52.400 --> 29:55.160
Upstairs, there's another girl,
also quite pretty.

29:55.240 --> 29:56.600
We'll pair her up with you.

29:56.680 --> 29:58.320
We're sure to get a good price.

29:58.400 --> 30:00.600
We're striking it rich today!

30:01.720 --> 30:03.640
You just want money?

30:03.720 --> 30:05.600
Please, let me go.

30:05.680 --> 30:07.120
I work with jade.

30:07.200 --> 30:10.600
I can get you gold and jewels.
Please, let me go. I'm begging you.

30:10.680 --> 30:13.120
Gold and jewels? I'll take them.

30:13.840 --> 30:16.080
And you… I'll take you too.

30:27.280 --> 30:29.560
Duanwu!

30:29.640 --> 30:31.880
Duanwu!

30:32.720 --> 30:34.320
You are coming right to us.

30:34.400 --> 30:35.800
We're rich!

30:37.640 --> 30:38.600
Let her go!

30:50.120 --> 30:52.960
Duanwu, I'm scared…

30:55.600 --> 30:57.400
Don't be afraid. I'm here.

31:00.120 --> 31:01.920
The city gates are already closed.

31:02.880 --> 31:04.920
Let's just stay here for the night.

31:05.000 --> 31:07.480
Finding Duanwu is more urgent.

31:17.640 --> 31:18.960
Anyone here?

31:19.760 --> 31:21.840
Anyone here? We need a room!

31:37.800 --> 31:40.120
Who are you? Why are you tied up here?

31:40.200 --> 31:43.400
We were wronged by two vile women!
Those brats…

31:44.000 --> 31:46.640
If I catch them,
I won't let them off easy!

31:48.240 --> 31:49.840
Sir! Please save us.

31:49.920 --> 31:52.600
Please, help us! Sir!

31:53.720 --> 31:54.560
It's Duanwu's arrow.

31:54.640 --> 31:55.600
Sir!

31:55.680 --> 31:57.880
It's Duanwu's arrow! Quick!

31:58.960 --> 32:00.600
Free us first!

32:00.680 --> 32:01.880
Duanwu!

32:03.200 --> 32:06.160
-Duanwu!
-Duanwu!

32:09.680 --> 32:10.680
Duanwu!

32:13.080 --> 32:15.480
Come out! I'm Zhang Jinran.

32:20.880 --> 32:22.760
-Duanwu!
-Sir!

32:22.840 --> 32:24.600
Out here in the middle of nowhere,
where will you look for her?

32:24.680 --> 32:27.480
The blood on the arrowhead hasn't dried.
She couldn't have gone far.

32:27.560 --> 32:29.720
-Move aside! Move aside!
-Sir! Sir! If Duanwu wants to hide,

32:29.800 --> 32:31.280
you won't be able to find her.

32:31.360 --> 32:34.040
Judging by the situation here,
she should be safe.

32:34.560 --> 32:37.240
Since she was around here,
they're likely heading to the city.

32:37.320 --> 32:39.960
Tomorrow, we'll go to Bianzhou City
to look for them.

32:56.480 --> 32:57.520
Duanwu.

33:00.760 --> 33:02.080
Did you sleep well?

33:02.840 --> 33:05.520
It's been so long
since I've slept this soundly.

33:09.200 --> 33:11.600
-Let's have breakfast.
-Duanwu.

33:11.680 --> 33:14.400
I have good news for you. Look!

33:14.960 --> 33:16.120
My hands are healed.

33:20.360 --> 33:24.080
Weren't you staying with Mr. Zhang?
How did you end up kidnapped?

33:26.000 --> 33:28.120
In the camp,
they said something happened to you.

33:28.200 --> 33:29.080
I was terrified.

33:29.760 --> 33:33.800
Mr. Zhang never came back,
so I went to the desert to find you.

33:33.880 --> 33:35.080
But I couldn't find you anywhere.

33:36.120 --> 33:38.120
Thankfully, I found you now.

33:38.200 --> 33:40.480
Now, we can stay together forever.

33:57.840 --> 33:58.920
Yunxiu,

34:00.880 --> 34:03.480
I've already paid the inn
for a month for you.

34:04.160 --> 34:05.960
Just settle in and rest.

34:07.240 --> 34:10.159
If you feel unwell,
just tell the innkeeper.

34:10.719 --> 34:13.440
And here's some money,
enough for your journey.

34:13.960 --> 34:15.760
Take this money,

34:15.840 --> 34:18.440
go to Chang'an if you wish,
or look for Mr. Zhang.

34:19.520 --> 34:23.920
I told you, once your hands are healed,
you can make a life for yourself anywhere.

34:27.080 --> 34:29.360
Duanwu, I don't want money.

34:29.440 --> 34:31.760
I won't go to Chang'an.
I won't go looking for Mr. Zhang.

34:31.840 --> 34:33.040
I just want to stay with you!

34:35.800 --> 34:36.960
You can't stay with me.

34:37.040 --> 34:39.239
Why? Why can't I stay with you?

34:39.320 --> 34:41.239
I won't go to Chang'an.
I won't go looking for Mr. Zhang.

34:41.320 --> 34:43.120
Why can't I stay with you?

34:43.199 --> 34:44.080
Yunxiu.

34:45.480 --> 34:46.639
Shrimp is dead.

34:56.719 --> 34:57.880
Shrimp is dead.

35:04.520 --> 35:06.480
I failed to protect him.

35:08.720 --> 35:10.200
Cao Da is dead too.

35:17.800 --> 35:18.840
Be good,

35:19.440 --> 35:23.400
take this money,
go to Chang'an or anywhere.

35:25.200 --> 35:26.280
Be obedient.

35:31.440 --> 35:33.680
Duanwu! Duanwu.

35:34.920 --> 35:38.240
Shrimp and the others are gone,
but you still have me.

35:39.840 --> 35:42.560
My hands are healed now. I'll protect you!

35:43.240 --> 35:44.240
Don't leave.

35:46.520 --> 35:48.800
Duanwu, trust me.

35:48.880 --> 35:53.000
Duanwu,
I would give my life to protect you.

35:53.520 --> 35:54.880
Don't leave.

36:02.920 --> 36:04.320
Let's buy some cakes for the journey.

36:04.400 --> 36:05.440
Freshly baked cakes!

36:05.960 --> 36:07.720
-Get some cakes.
-Alright.

36:08.560 --> 36:11.600
-Make sure they're warm. Thanks.
-Sure thing.

36:22.200 --> 36:23.200
Thank you.

36:23.720 --> 36:24.720
Four cash.

36:25.720 --> 36:26.960
Okay.

36:27.600 --> 36:29.120
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

36:31.560 --> 36:35.000
Cakes! Freshly baked cakes!

36:36.000 --> 36:37.560
Come and take a look!

36:47.240 --> 36:51.360
BIANZHOU CITY

36:54.560 --> 36:57.480
We've searched all over Bianzhou.
There's no trace of her.

36:58.120 --> 36:59.600
Maybe Duanwu have left the city.

36:59.680 --> 37:01.320
They must be nearby.

37:01.840 --> 37:03.000
I will find her.

37:03.080 --> 37:05.640
But Prince Ying has repeatedly urged you
to return to Chang'an.

37:06.600 --> 37:09.080
If you delay any longer,
it may not go over well.

37:10.360 --> 37:12.480
Don't worry.
I'll assign men to keep looking.

37:12.560 --> 37:13.560
Alright.

37:18.920 --> 37:20.600
Hyah! Hyah!

37:22.800 --> 37:25.080
I didn't expect
such a pleasant surprise on the way.

37:25.600 --> 37:27.600
These three young ladies
all look quite nice.

37:28.360 --> 37:31.160
For these ones, we'll have to negotiate
separately with the buyer.

37:32.120 --> 37:34.280
Don't worry.
We'll discuss once we reach Yangzhou.

37:55.920 --> 37:56.960
Run!

37:57.560 --> 37:58.600
-Don't let them get away!
-Stop!

37:58.680 --> 37:59.520
Don't run!

37:59.600 --> 38:01.160
-Chase!
-Run, Tan!

38:02.320 --> 38:03.320
Stop!

38:03.400 --> 38:04.440
Don't run!

38:05.920 --> 38:07.040
Stop!

38:07.840 --> 38:08.840
Stop!

38:09.760 --> 38:10.760
Don't run!

38:13.040 --> 38:14.960
Don't run! Catch her!

38:15.040 --> 38:16.080
Quick!

38:16.920 --> 38:19.920
-Don't run! Didn't you hear me?
-Master Shijiu!

38:20.000 --> 38:21.040
Don't run!

38:23.360 --> 38:24.480
-Over there!
-Tong!

38:24.560 --> 38:25.920
Chase!

38:28.400 --> 38:29.440
Hurry!

38:30.440 --> 38:32.160
Over there! Chase them!

38:33.320 --> 38:34.320
Stop!

38:35.480 --> 38:36.520
Stop!

38:37.080 --> 38:38.000
Stop!

38:41.920 --> 38:42.800
This way.

38:46.960 --> 38:47.880
Prince Ying!

38:54.240 --> 38:55.280
Zhang Jinran.

38:56.600 --> 38:58.040
Let me have a good look at you.

38:59.520 --> 39:00.640
You look so travel-worn.

39:02.240 --> 39:03.840
You've been all over.

39:03.920 --> 39:05.920
It must have been at least a year.

39:06.000 --> 39:07.040
Thanks for worrying about you.

39:07.720 --> 39:09.600
When I heard
you were returning to Chang'an,

39:09.680 --> 39:11.240
I was overjoyed.

39:11.320 --> 39:13.280
I prepared a table for you
with all your favorite dishes.

39:14.080 --> 39:15.160
Enjoy it.

39:16.120 --> 39:17.400
You've been so considerate.

39:21.880 --> 39:23.120
You may all leave.

39:29.680 --> 39:30.640
I'll handle it.

39:32.720 --> 39:35.680
Now that you're back,
don't go wandering again.

39:37.120 --> 39:39.960
What's the matter? Still not settled?

39:43.040 --> 39:45.240
The position of Secretariat Drafter
awaits you.

39:45.320 --> 39:47.600
His Majesty has mentioned you many times.

39:47.680 --> 39:49.560
This time, I went to Hepu,

39:50.080 --> 39:52.760
then traveled from Lingnan
through Shannan to Hexi.

39:54.080 --> 39:58.800
I saw hardships and suffering
like I've never seen in my life.

39:59.320 --> 40:02.480
So, I don't wish to take up the post.

40:03.680 --> 40:05.320
I want to see this through to the end.

40:06.000 --> 40:10.200
So, you're still entangled
in the Yan family's tribute case?

40:11.960 --> 40:13.880
It's not just about solving one case.

40:13.960 --> 40:15.640
I want to bring justice
for those caught in the middle,

40:16.240 --> 40:19.600
whose lives and fates
were beyond their control.

40:19.680 --> 40:21.960
But their lives and fates

40:23.200 --> 40:24.280
are beyond your reach.

40:25.440 --> 40:26.480
Stay in Chang'an,

40:26.560 --> 40:28.680
and you'll be the youngest
Secretariat Drafter,

40:29.200 --> 40:31.720
His Majesty's favored young talent.

40:31.800 --> 40:35.000
Your writings will depict
a golden age of culture,

40:35.080 --> 40:37.840
not the bloody harshness of punishment.

40:37.920 --> 40:38.880
No.

40:40.360 --> 40:41.600
Justice in punishment,

40:42.600 --> 40:44.000
like a clear mirror held high.

40:44.640 --> 40:45.680
Isn't that what a golden age truly is?

40:50.600 --> 40:51.880
Enough.

40:52.840 --> 40:56.000
I've always known your nature.
I can't sway you.

40:58.640 --> 41:00.880
His Majesty is holding a banquet
at the palace today.

41:01.400 --> 41:03.080
Join me for it first,

41:03.160 --> 41:05.800
then decide if you stay or go.

41:28.600 --> 41:30.440
Tong!

41:30.960 --> 41:32.800
Tan!

41:34.120 --> 41:36.240
Tong!
